OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for homeless hostel on former
OL,4,Acare home site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn a former old people's
OL,7,Fhome into a homeless hostel have been
OL,8,Frecommended for approval.
OL,10,FOn Wednesday, West Berkshire
OL,11,Fcouncillors will debate the plans for a
OL,12,Fmaximum of 16 residents to be
OL,13,Faccommodated at the former Chestnut
OL,14,FWalk Care Home in Hungerford.
OL,16,FTwenty-three people have written to the
OL,17,Fcouncil raising concerns, and Thames
OL,18,FValley Police has also objected to the
OL,19,Fchange of use.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
