OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for homeless hostel on former
OL,4,Acare home site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said robust management,
OL,7,Fsafeguarding and risk assessment
OL,8,Fprocedures would be in place, including
OL,9,Fongoing monitoring, welfare checks and
OL,10,Fregular reviews.
